# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values for local development.
# See `.env.example` for the full variable list and production checklist.
#
# Required for local auth redirects + Stripe return URLs:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
#
# Identity & location verification (Stripe Identity):
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY
#   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#   Enable Identity webhook events listed in `.env.example`.
#
# Phone verification (Supabase Auth SMS / phone_change):
#   Configure Phone + SMS provider in the Supabase Dashboard (not app env vars).
#
# Email confirmed step:
#   Supabase Auth “Confirm email” + Site URL / Redirect URLs for /auth/callback
